		<title>Eric Lengyel: Created page with &quot;__NOTOC__ '''Release date:''' March 22, 2023  == Core Engine ==  * The &lt;code&gt;Color4C&lt;/code&gt; class has been renamed to [http://c4engine.com/docs/Math/Color4U.html &lt;code&gt;Color4U&lt;/code&gt;] to reflect the fact that it has unsigned components. There are also new classes called [http://c4engine.com/docs/Math/Color2U.html &lt;code&gt;Color2U&lt;/code&gt;], [http://c4engine.com/docs/Math/Color2S.html &lt;code&gt;Color2S&lt;/code&gt;], and [http://c4engine.com/docs/Math/Color4S.html &lt;code&gt;Color4S&lt;/code&gt;],...&quot;</title>
